---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="S5 · GIS site analysis" description="Slope, drainage, tree canopy and land-use analysis map set — in progress.">
  <div class="wrap-wide">
  <section class="hero">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Project S5 · GIS &amp; site analysis</p>
      <h1>GIS site analysis</h1>
      <p class="lede">A QGIS-based site analysis package built on the S1 survey and city open data: slope and aspect,
        drainage, existing tree canopy, and surrounding land use, issued as a short analysis map book.</p>
      <span class="status planned">In progress</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <h2>Planned deliverables</h2>
  <ul class="plain">
    <li>Slope, aspect and drainage analysis derived from the S1 surface</li>
    <li>Tree canopy and surrounding land-use maps from City of Calgary open data</li>
    <li>A 3–5 page analysis map book, each sheet with a legend, scale bar, north arrow and data source</li>
  </ul>
  </div>
</Layout>
